              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo Ruti umwina Moabu atile, “Ulya muntu acinjeba nokutila, ‘Wikaleka ukubomba pamo na babomfi bandi mpakafye bakapwishe ukusombola imbuto shandi shonse.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
