              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao Naomi atile kuli Ruti nafyala, “Ee cisuma iwe we mwana wandi ukuti ulebomba na bakashana bakwa Boasi, pantu mwibala lya muntu umbi kuti bakusanshilamo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
